OL,3,GNEWSACrime victims urged to join
OL,4,A'listening' meetings
OL,5,
OL,6,FVictims of crime are being urged to
OL,7,Ftake part in a scheme to help
OL,8,Fauthorities better understand the
OL,9,Fimpact offending has on communities.
OL,11,FThe police and crime commissioner for
OL,12,FDurham and Darlington Joy Allen is
OL,13,Flaunching "listening surgeries" across
OL,14,Fthe area to give people a chance to
OL,15,Fshare their experiences.
OL,17,FAllen, who oversees Durham Police and
OL,18,Fits budget, said she would also aim to
OL,19,Fmeet with community groups and
OL,20,Fbusinesses to host wider discussions on
OL,21,Fpublic safety.
OL,23,APub: 07-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NE Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,400,390,260,160,0,100
